SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with **Love Songs 
 that Stir the Soul.**\n\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWonderful new so
 ngs every week!\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time after 9:00 pm (E
 astern Time)\n\\*You are also welcome to come on later in the evening as w
 ell\n**\\*\\*Attend for free if you like - if it's your first time attendi
 ng :)**\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwri
 ter/Producer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that S
 tir the Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs by Songwrite
 r and Lyricist Steve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, spiritual s
 ongs\, and many other fun surprises!\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs usi
 ng a fusion of mixed genres like\, **Folk\, Traditional Folk\, Country\, B
 lue Grass\, Singer Song Writer\, Soft Rock\, Easy Listening\, Classic Rock
 \, R & B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult Contemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**p and many o
 thers genres too. So please sit back and get ready to have an amazing audi
 tory experience in the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on 
 and off at any time during the night- starting at 9:00 pm\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\nFree if it's your first time attending onli
 ne with me :)\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send throug
 h e transfer or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything yo
 u can contribute is greatly appreciated to help support this meaningful mu
 sical endeavor and song loving community\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://u
 s04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonials from Past Events:**\n\nSteve Flemmi
 ng is an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the soul. He transforms ever
 yday thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and magical tunes. Amazing st
 uff yet again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a night of heartfelt\, 
 exhilarating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for having me my friend.
  I love your words\, they calm me and energize me at the same time I'll lo
 ok forward to your next invite\nM.Z.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-
