SUMMARY:The Joyful June Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party! (Saturday\, June 6th
 )
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  for a Joyful June Saturday Night Karaoke Party where we will meet at our 
 groups cozy location\, **The Celtic Irish Pub**. **(on main floor)** This 
 friendly pub is conveniently located at Yonge & Davisville- very close to 
 the Davisville subway.\nFree Parking on Duplex (just a block west of Yonge
 )\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Where and When to Meet us?**\n**Location: Celtic Iri
 sh Pub**\n(Just mention Steve from Meetup when you arrive- to find our res
 erved section)\n**Date:** Saturday June 6th\, 2026\n**Address:** 1954 Yong
 e St Toronto\, ON M4S 3E5 (on main floor)\n**Arrive between:** 7:30 pm and
  9:30 pm (if you can) (Dinner Menu Provided)\n**Free Parking** on Duplex j
 ust west of Yonge\n**Taking Subway:** 1 minute walk north of Yonge-Davisvi
 lle Subway\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Or
 ganizer)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nEv
 ent Details:\n**The Joyful June Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party! (Saturday\, 
 June 6th)**\n\n-We will meet inside (reserved seating) and look forward to
  a great night to mix\, mingle\, share some laughs and then Karaoke after 
 the mixer\n\n\\*Plan to come for dinner too if you like (a fabulous dinner
  menu)\n\\*Invite your friends too\; or come on your own (either way\, we'
 re going to have a blast and make lots of new friends!)\n\\*Choose to sing
  or merely enjoy a super enthused energy all night long!\n**Please be cour
 teous to the Restaurant and Staff:**\n**\\*One beverage (preferably two be
 verages if you are staying for more than two hours) (and/or appetizer/meal
  minimum to** **support the venue-please plan to come for dinner too if yo
 u like-many of us do :)**\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we can an
 ticipate a fantastic turn out :)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**EVENT FEE and Arrival
  Times:**\n\n\\*Please arrive between 7:30 pm and 9:30 pm (if you can)\n\n
 **Event Fee: (Cash only at the door)**\n10 dollars cash or in advance by e
  transfer too:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.c
 om/)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*Free Parking on Duplex (blo
 ck west of Yonge) Residential area\, with paid street parking and parking 
 lot on Yonge street
